# Keep immutable Phoenix component release sources complete in Git. These
# narrow exceptions do not include dependency caches or build output.
!phoenix-components/**/README.md
!phoenix-components/**/package-lock.json
!phoenix-components/**/src/data/
!phoenix-components/**/src/data/**
